<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[58vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367603/eurocert/op.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-75" alt="ISO 37001:2025 Anti-Bribery Management System Certification"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/45 via-[#030a16]/25 to-[#030a16]/60"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 py-16 lg:py-20 text-center"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto bg-[#030a16]/55 backdrop-blur-[2px] border border-white/15 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8"><h2 class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 text-[11px] md:text-xs mb-4 tracking-[0.6em] uppercase">Anti-Bribery Management System Certification</h2><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold mb-2 text-white" style="text-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.65), 0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.25)">ISO 37001:2025 Certification</h1><div class="divider-line mb-6"></div><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-4">Build a stronger, more transparent organization with ISO 37001:2025 Certification. This standard helps businesses prevent, detect and respond to bribery risks through structured anti-bribery policies, internal controls, due diligence and continual improvement.</p><p class="text-white text-sm md:text-base max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-semibold mb-6">Eurocert provides professional ISO 37001:2025 certification services to help organizations demonstrate integrity, improve governance and build trust with clients, regulators, investors and business partners.</p><ul class="max-w-4xl mx-auto grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-left text-white/85 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-eurogold-400 mt-1 text-xs"></i><span>Prevent and manage bribery risks</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-eurogold-400 mt-1 text-xs"></i><span>Strengthen ethical governance</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-eurogold-400 mt-1 text-xs"></i><span>Improve compliance confidence</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-eurogold-400 mt-1 text-xs"></i><span>Build trust with stakeholders</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 sm:col-span-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-eurogold-400 mt-1 text-xs"></i><span>Support tender and business eligibility</span></li></ul><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 justify-center items-center mt-8"><a class="btn-portal heading-font text-sm" href="/contact/">Get Certified</a><button type="button" class="btn-portal heading-font text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-2">Request a Quote <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i></button></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What is <span class="text-euro-600">ISO 37001:2025</span>?</h2><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">ISO 37001:2025 is an internationally recognized standard for Anti-Bribery Management Systems (ABMS). It provides a structured framework to help organizations identify bribery risks, implement proportionate anti-bribery controls, perform due diligence, and strengthen ethical business practices across operations and third-party relationships.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The 2025 edition is the second edition of ISO 37001 and replaces ISO 37001:2016. As stated in the official ISO publication, this edition cancels and replaces the first edition and has been technically revised to align with evolving governance, compliance, and anti-corruption expectations.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">ISO 37001:2025 is applicable to organizations of all sizes, including small, medium, and large entities across public, private, and non-profit sectors.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5"><h3 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Who should apply?</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Suitable for manufacturing, construction, government contractors, exporters, IT and service companies, healthcare, education, and non-profit organizations.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367612/eurocert/op1.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="ISO 37001:2025 anti-bribery management framework"/></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16] via-[#0a1628] to-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="lg:col-span-2 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 aspect-[16/9] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367621/eurocert/op2.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-contain bg-white transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="Why ISO 37001 certification is important"/></div><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-5"><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">Why ISO 37001:2025 Certification is Important</h2><p class="text-white/70 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Bribery and corruption can damage an organization&#x27;s reputation, create legal risks and reduce stakeholder confidence. ISO 37001:2025 Certification helps organizations show that they have implemented a formal system to manage bribery risks.</p><p class="text-white/70 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">This certification is useful for organizations involved in tenders, procurement, government contracts, international business, supplier management, construction projects, consultancy, manufacturing, healthcare, education, finance and service industries.</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-1"><div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white/75 text-sm">Protects reputation and trust</div><div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white/75 text-sm">Strengthens legal and compliance posture</div><div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white/75 text-sm">Improves governance across teams</div><div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white/75 text-sm">Supports tender and contract confidence</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-500 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Key Benefits</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Key Benefits of ISO 37001:2025 Certification</h2></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 hover:border-eurogold-400/50 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center text-eurogold-500 mb-4"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-base"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Builds Trust and Credibility</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Demonstrates recognized anti-bribery practices and ethical business controls.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 hover:border-eurogold-400/50 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center text-eurogold-500 mb-4"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-base"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Reduces Bribery and Corruption Risks</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Helps identify high-risk areas and apply controls to prevent bribery.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 hover:border-eurogold-400/50 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center text-eurogold-500 mb-4"><i class="fas fa-balance-scale text-base"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Strengthens Corporate Governance</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Supports leadership accountability, reporting, and responsible decision-making.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 hover:border-eurogold-400/50 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center text-eurogold-500 mb-4"><i class="fas fa-briefcase text-base"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Supports Tender and Business Opportunities</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Improves qualification for bids and contracts with strong compliance requirements.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 hover:border-eurogold-400/50 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center text-eurogold-500 mb-4"><i class="fas fa-users text-base"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Improves Stakeholder Confidence</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Builds trust with customers, investors, regulators, suppliers, and partners.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 hover:border-eurogold-400/50 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center text-eurogold-500 mb-4"><i class="fas fa-leaf text-base"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Supports ESG and Compliance Goals</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Reinforces governance, ethics, transparency, and responsible operations.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16] via-[#0a1628] to-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-3">Who Should Apply for ISO 37001:2025 Certification?</h2><p class="text-white/70 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-6">ISO 37001:2025 Certification is suitable for:</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="p-4 rounded-