cking-tight mb-2">Frequently Asked Questions</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Quick answers about ISO 37001:2025 certification.</p></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 mb-2"><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/15 text-eurogold-600 text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</span><h4 class="heading-font text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900">What is ISO 37001:2025 Certification?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed pl-9">ISO 37001:2025 Certification is a certification for Anti-Bribery Management Systems. It helps organizations prevent, detect and respond to bribery risks.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 mb-2"><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/15 text-eurogold-600 text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span><h4 class="heading-font text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900">Is ISO 37001:2025 mandatory?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed pl-9">ISO 37001:2025 is generally voluntary unless required by a client, tender, regulator or contract. However, it is highly useful for organizations that want to demonstrate strong anti-bribery controls.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 mb-2"><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/15 text-eurogold-600 text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span><h4 class="heading-font text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900">Which organizations can apply for ISO 37001:2025?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed pl-9">Any organization can apply, including private companies, public-sector organizations, NGOs, educational institutions, healthcare organizations, manufacturers, exporters and service providers.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 mb-2"><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/15 text-eurogold-600 text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">4</span><h4 class="heading-font text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900">Can ISO 37001:2025 be integrated with other ISO standards?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed pl-9">Yes. ISO 37001:2025 can be integrated with other management system standards such as ISO 9001, ISO 14001, ISO 45001, ISO 27001 and ISO 37301.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 mb-2"><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/15 text-eurogold-600 text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">5</span><h4 class="heading-font text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900">Does ISO 37001:2025 certification guarantee that bribery will never happen?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed pl-9">No certification can guarantee that bribery will never occur. However, ISO 37001:2025 helps organizations implement structured controls to reduce bribery risk and respond effectively if concerns arise.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto p-10 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><h4 class